		Tattoo set (custom content, ids 9540-9552). Not official L2 items - descriptions/values
		come from the client's own itemname-e.dat (ids 9540-9551 already exist there in Portuguese;
		9552 "Tattoo AIO" only existed in the patch, not in the live client).
		Equipped in the "back" (cloak) slot: confirmed unused by any other item in this datapack,
		and cosmetically inert on the Interlude client (no visible cloak rendering), so it doesn't
		clash with any outfit.
		NOTE: the client description text for both "GM Power" tattoos lists the M.Def/P.Def bonus
		inconsistently ("100%" then "+35" flat in the same sentence). Treated here as +135 flat
		M.Def/P.Def - flag this to the player-facing text if it needs to match exactly.
	-->

	<item id="9540" type="Armor" name="Tattoo of Fight Lv. 1">
		<set name="default_action" val="equip" />
		<set name="bodypart" val="back" />
		<set name="material" val="LIQUID" />
		<set name="weight" val="10" />
		<for>
			<add order="0x10" stat="runSpd" val="7" />
